<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">HEBRIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrifoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEBRIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBRIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul hworɔle krataa he kɔyɛ 60-61 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeti ebia ne baye ye bafi prizin wɔ Roman, anaa ne waha kaa maa bɛye ye. Edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ krataa nanu ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ, ɔhworɔ mane Hebrifoɛ Kristofoɛ bɔ ne bɛwɔ Yudea ne. Sɔ mmenia nemɔ bie wale Kristofoɛ asafo nanu ne, nná ɛnɛ ɔ, nakoso yɛkɔha paa a, né bayɛ kyɛ mmenia bɔ behia nyɔfonesue ne, ɔtte aleɛ bɔ enu yɛ se ɔ. Né ɔyɛ suro paa, ofikyɛ ne Yudafoɛ asɔre mbanyi ne bɛ bɔ bɛta bɛ si ne atu bɛ nye asie Kristofoɛ naso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Né sɔ asɔre mbanyi nemɔ kyire kyɛ, Kristosom de, olle nyinasoɛ biala, na bɛlle hwee bɔ begyina so bɛka kyɛ bɛsõ Nyameɛ ɔ. Yudafoɛ nemɔ de, né bɛle asɔre awuro kandinga, asɔfo, atee bɔ bɛfa so bɛbɔ afɔleɛ, Mose mmeraa ne, ɔne abakwasɛm bɔ ɔkɔ tonn kosi Abraham so ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeti, ne Paul pena kyɛ Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛte Kristofoɛ ne nya gyidie bɔ enu yɛ se kyɛ, atee bɔ Kristofoɛ ne fa so sõ Nyameɛ ne, odi mu koraa tra Yudafoɛ nemɔ deɛ ne. Osa maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, Yuda som ne apɛ nu, na Nyameɛ afa Kristosom mmom yeɛ waasi ye gya nu ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo te piri tra abɔfo nemɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4–2:18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo te piri tra Mose ne Yosef (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1–4:13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo asɔfodie ne di mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14–7:28</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo apam ne di mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1–9:22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo afɔleɛ ne di mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23–10:39</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛbɔ bɛhyirele kyɛ bɛle gyidie (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1–12:29</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yɛ bɔ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbaeɛ bɔ ɔfa yiele (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Tete ne, Nyameɛ nate adiifoɛ so dwudwo hyirele yɛ baba mɔ. Ɔfale atee ahoroɛ so yɛle sɔ mmerɛ pee. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Nakoso awieɛ mmerɛ he anu de, ɔnate Ɔwa naso yeɛ wadwudwo wahyire yɛ ɔ. Ye yeɛ waye ye kyɛ ɔnea nikye biala so ne, afei koso ɔnate ye so yeɛ ɔbɔle nikye biala ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Ye yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu Nyameɛ anuonyam, ɔte kyɛ Baba ne pɛpɛɛpɛ, na ɔnate ye dwirɛ bɔ tumi wɔ nu naso maa nningyein mukoraati kɔ so tena berɛ. Ɔtele yɛ nwo fili yɛ bɔne nwo yiele ne, ɔɔtenane Otumvoɛ ne sa famaa so wɔ anwuro. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Yeti bama ye so batra abɔfo nemɔ, na wanya dumaa bɔ odi mu tra bɛ deɛ ne koraa. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Ofikyɛ abɔfo nanu nwa yeɛ Nyameɛ aha ahyire ye le kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ɛte mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na ɛnɛ mayɛ wɔ Baba” ɔ?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Anaa ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ngɔyɛ ye Baba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na ye wora wayɛ mma” ɔ?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Ɔma ye Piesie ne ba aseɛ he aso bieku ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmerɛ bɔ ɔma ye Piesie ne ba aseɛ he aso ne.”</char></note> ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Ma Nyameɛ abɔfo namukoraati koto ye.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Osa hane abɔfo nemɔ nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Honhom yeɛ ɔfa yɛ ye abɔfo ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">na ye asomvoɛ de, see bɔ ɔsɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Nakoso Ɔwa ne de, ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Nyameɛ te wɔ bia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɔ okyire deinn bia bɔ ɔhene tena so ne.</char></note> daa daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">na w'Ahennie pɔmaa te tenenee pɔmaa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ɛdɔ tenenee, na ɛkyi amumuyɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Ɛhene ati yeɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">wɔ Nyameɛ afa ahurusi ngoo asra wɔ atra wɔ nnamvo mɔ ne.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Yeɛ osa hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“O Awurade, ahyɛaseɛ ne, ɛtole aseɛ fapem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">na anwuro te wɔ sa noa adwuma.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Bɛkɔsɛkye, nakoso wɔ de, ɛwɔ berɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">ye mukoraati kɔyɛ daa te kyɛ atadeɛ.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ɛkɔbobɔ bɛ te kyɛ ɛtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">na bɛkɔsesa te kyɛ atadeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Nakoso, wɔ de, kyɛbɔ ɛte nala yeɛ ɛte ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">na w'afoɛ ngɔwa awieɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Na abɔfo nanu beni yeɛ Nyameɛ aha ahyire ye le kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Tena me sa famaa so kodwu kyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">ngɔfa w'atamfo ngogua wɔ gya bo” ɔ?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Aso bɛ mukoraati bɛtte ahonhom bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma krongron, bɔ bɛsoma bɛ maa bɛkɔsõ bɛbɔ bekonya ngoa ne?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ɛhe ati, odikyɛ yɛfa y'adwene yesie nningyein bɔ yɛte naso paa, na yandwe yɛ nwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ofikyɛ, sɛ edwirɛ bɔ bɛmaa abɔfo mɔ hane ne yɛle nahorɛ, na mmerato ne asoserɛ biala nyane ye asotwe bɔ ɔfata ye a, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />ye de, sɛ yɛbu yɛ nye yɛgua atee pirikua bɔ ɔkɔfa so kole yɛ naso a, yɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne yafa yɛ nwo yali? Awurade bɔbɔ yeɛ oli moa hane ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ, na bɛ bɔ bɛtele ne ha tole so kyɛ ɔte nahorɛ, <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />na Nyameɛ koso nate nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ ne honhom krongron akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔkyekyɛle kyɛbɔ ye pɛ te naso lili ye nwo adanzeɛ.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Ewiase bɔ ɔba, bɔ yɛka ye nwo dwirɛ ne, nná abɔfo yeɛ Nyameɛ afa awura bɛ sa ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Mmom bɛlili ye nwo adanzeɛ wɔ nekaa bie kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Sona po te nzu bɔ ɛkaye ye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">na dasaniɛ te nzu bɔ ɛdwene ye nwo ne?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Amaa wawa ase kaa watra abɔfo nemɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">afa anuonyam ne nidie abɔ ye abotire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">na afa wɔ sa anoa adwuma awura ye sa.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Afa nikye biala agua ye gya bo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ fale nikye biala wurale ye sa ne, nikye fee nne berɛ bɔ wamva wanwura yebo ɔ. Kesaalae de, yɛnnwu nningyein bɔ wafa wawura ye sa ne. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Nakoso Yesu bɔ bɛmaa ɔwale ase kaa trale abɔfo nemɔ ne, yɛnwu kyɛ ɔnate amaneɛ bɔ onwuni ye tonn oodwuli ewue nu nati, bafa anuonyam ne nidie babɔ ye abotire, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔnate Nyameɛ adom so kɔha ewue kɔnea kɔma ebiala.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne wahyɛ mmeni pee anuonyam ne, né ɔte pa kyɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔbɔle nikye biala, na yeti yeɛ nikye biala wɔ berɛ ne maa Yesu bɔ otira bɛ ngoa nzafoa ne nwu amaneɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okoli mu, na wahyɛ ye mmaa pee anuonyam. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Na Yesu bɔ ɔte mmenia nwo ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ ɔte bɛ nwo namukoraati fi neka-horɛ, yeti ɔnyɛ ye fɛle kyɛ ɔkɔfrɛ bɛ aliemaa mɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Na ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ngɔbɔ wɔ dumaa ngohyire nniema mɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">ngɔfa ayɛyie dwein ngɔye wɔ ayɛ wɔ asafo nanu.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Yeɛ osa hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Ngɔfa me nwo ngɔto ye so.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Na ɔhane ye bieku kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Nea, mene ngwalaa bɔ Awurade afa bɛ ama me ne.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ngwalaa ne te mogya ne anwoɔnaen nati, ye koso ɔɔyɛle mogya ne anwoɔnaen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔnate ye wue naso kɔsɛkye Abɔnzam bɔ ɔfa ewue ba ne. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Ná wamaa bɛ bɔ ewue nwo suronyi ti, bafa bɛ ngoa mukoraati bayɛ ngoaa ne anya ahofadie.<verse eid="HEB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, nná abɔfo yeɛ ɔboka bɛ ɔ, mmom ɔboka Abraham bosofoɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ye sɔ nati, né odikyɛ ɔyɛ kyɛ oliema nemɔ wɔ nikye biala nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ sɔfo panyi bɔ onwu anwunvoin na odi nahorɛ wɔ ɔsom bɔ ɔfa ma Nyameɛ nanu, na wamaa wabɔ afɔleɛ wapata mmenia né bɔne. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Na ɔnate kyɛ bɛsɔle ye bɛneane maa onwuni amaneɛ nati, ɔkora boka bɛbɔ bɛsɔ bɛ bɛnea ne.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ akrongronfoɛ, bɔ bafrɛ ɛmɔ baboka bɛbɔ bɛkɔ anwuro naso, ɛmɔdwene Yesu bɔ ɔte somafoɛ ne sɔfo panyi bɔ yedɛ ye yɛtonu nanwo. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Olili Nyameɛ nahorɛ, kyɛbɔ Mose koso lili nahorɛ wɔ nikye biala nu wɔ Nyameɛ awuro berɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Nakoso bɛnwu ye kyɛ ole anuonyam tra Mose, ofikyɛ bɔ osi sua ne le anuonyam koraa tra sua ne. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, awuro biala ebie yeɛ osi ɔ, na bɔ ɔyɛle nikye biala yeɛ ole Nyameɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Ne Mose te somvoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ awuro berɛ, na olili nikye biala nu nahorɛ fa lili edwirɛ bɔ né bɛkɔha ye kyẽabie nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Nakoso Kristo de, olili nahorɛ kyɛ Baa bɔ ɔnea Nyameɛ awuro naso. Awuro ne yeɛ ole yɛ, nakoso sana yɛsɔ akukuduro ne anidasoɛ bɔ yɛle ye nanu yɛkodwu awieɛ.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Yeti, kyɛbɔ honhom krongron ne ka ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Ɛnɛ, sɛ ɛmɔte ye konvi a,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />nnɛmɔyɛ asoserɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">te kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele me so atua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">na bɛsɔle me bɛneane wɔ ɛserɛ naso ne,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />nekaa bɔ ɛmɔ nana mɔ gyegyele me, na bɛsɔle me bɛneane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ né bafa afoɛ 40 banwu me nyumaa ne.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Ɛhe ati, sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ne nwo yɛle me ahi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">na ngane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Daa biala bɛmini atee wɔ b'ahone nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">na bennya bɛnwuni m'atee.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Yeti, mvɛle yaa ngane ndaen kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Bengowura me nwomeɛ nu lle.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔnea yé paa na ɛmɔ nu biala annya ahone tɛɛ bɔ olle gyidie, ná wandwe ye nwo wamvi Nyameɛ teasefoɛ nanwo; <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />mmom ɛmɔhɔ so bɛhyehyɛ ɛmɔ nwo nguraen kyẽa biala bɔ bɛfrɛ ye “Ɛnɛ” ne, na bɔne anlaka-laka ɛmɔ nu biala ma wanyɛ asoserɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Ofikyɛ, sɛ yɛkɔhora yekonya kyɛfa wɔ Kristo nu a, sana yɛsɔ ahotɔsoɛ bɔ ahyɛaseɛ ne, yɛnyane ye nanu yɛkosi awieɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Kyɛbɔ baha ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Ɛnɛ, sɛ ɛmɔte ye konvi a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nnɛmɔyɛ asoserɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">te kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele me so atua ne.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Nwamɔ yeɛ bɛtele, nakoso bɛtele ye so atua ne? Nná bɛ bɔ Mose lili bɛ nyunu yele bɛ fili Egypt namukoraati? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Afei, nwamɔ yeɛ bɛ nwo yɛle Nyameɛ ahi afoɛ 40 ne? Nná bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle bɔne, maa bɛ fuin guale ɛserɛ naso ne? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Na nwamɔ yeɛ ɔhane bɛ ndaen kyɛ, bengowura ye nwomeɛ nu ne? Nná bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle asoserɛ ne? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Yeti yɛnwu ye kyɛ, gyidie bɔ bannya ye nati yeɛ bangora banwura ye nwomeɛ nu ne.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Yeti, ɔnate kyɛ bɔhyɛ tɛ́ wɔ berɛ kyɛ yɛkɔhora yɛkowura ye nwomeɛ nu nati, ɛmɔma yɛnea yé, wanyɛ sɔ a, ɛmɔ nu biemɔ sa ngɔha bɔhyɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ofikyɛ yɛ koso, baha nzɛmba ne bahyire yɛ, kyɛbɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nala; nakoso, mvasoɛ biala amma so amma bɛ, ofikyɛ banne banni. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Yɛ bɔ yale yali ne de, yahɔ sɔ nwomeɛ nanu kyɛbɔ ɔhane nala; ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Mvɛle yaa ngane ndaen kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Bengowura me nwomeɛ nu lle.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ɔwɔ nu, mmerɛ bɔ bɛhyɛle ewiase nabo ne, né wayie ye adwuma. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Ofikyɛ ɔhane kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo nanwo dwirɛ wɔ nekaa bie kyɛ: “Na kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo ne, Nyameɛ lɛle ye nwomeɛ fili ye adwuma mukoraati nwo,” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />yeɛ osa hane ye wɔ ɛwa kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:5">“Bengowura me nwomeɛ nu lle.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Yeti, ɔnate kyɛ ebiemɔ le ye nwo atee kyɛ bɛwura ye nwomeɛ nu, nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛli moa bɛhane nzɛmba ne bɛhyirele bɛ ne de, asoserɛ ti banwura nu ne, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Nyameɛ sa hyɛle kyẽa foforɛ tole berɛ kyɛ “Ɛnɛ,” na afoɛ pee si ne, ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane edwirɛ bɔ yali moa yaha ye wɔ David dwein nanu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Ɛnɛ, sɛ ɛmɔte ye konvi a, nnɛmɔyɛ asoserɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Sɛ Yosua fale bɛ hɔle nekaa bɔ bɛkole bɛ nwomeɛ a, ahaa ye si ne, Nyameɛ ngɔha kyẽa foforɛ nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Yeti, Nyameɛ mmenia tɛ́ le Homeda bie. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Ofikyɛ sona bɔ wawura Nyameɛ nwomeɛ nu ne, ye koso wale ye nwomeɛ wafi ye bɔbɔ ye adwuma nwo, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ lɛle ye nwomeɛ wɔ ye deɛ nwo ne. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ɛhene ati, ɛmɔma yɛyɛ bɔ yɛkɔhora biala yɛwura sɔ nwomeɛ nanu, ná wamma yɛ nu biala annyɛ asoserɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ne bie.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne te ase, na tumi wɔ nu, na ye noa yɛ nná tra dadeɛ biala bɔ ye nyunu ne ye si pɛ, na ɔkora wura nu tonn kɔpakye-pakye ɔkra ne honhom ne bowue ne fonyi nu, na ɔkora nwu adwene ne nzusuyɛɛ bɔ ɔwɔ ebie ahone nu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Na abɔdeɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ wafea wɔ nyunu ɔ, mmom nikye biala nwo la berɛ, na ɛso abukye pefee wɔ bɔ yɛkobu ngondaa yɛkohyire ye ne nyunu.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Yeti, ɔnate kyɛ yɛle sɔfo panyi paa, Nyameɛ awa Yesu bɔ wahɔ anwuro nati, ɛmɔma yɛhɔ so yɛha ye nwo dwirɛ ne yɛhyire mmenia. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ofikyɛ sɔfo panyi bɔ yɛle ye ne, ɔtte ebie bɔ ɔnde yɛ mmerɛyɛ bo, mmom ɔte ebie bɔ basɔ ye banea wɔ nikye biala nu te kyɛ yala, nakoso bɔne nne ye nwo. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Yeti, ɛmɔma yɛfa ahotɔsoɛ paa yɛhɔ adom ahennie bia ne nyunu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkonwu yɛ anwunvo, na yanya adom bɔ ɔkɔboka yɛ wɔ mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Sɔfo panyi biala bɔ bɛye ye bɛfi mmenia nanu ne, bɛye ye kyɛ ogyina mmenia ne gya nu yɛ Nyameɛ adwuma ma bɛ, ná ɔbɔ akyɛdeɛ ne bɔne nwo afɔleɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ɔse kyɛ ɔtɔ sii wɔ nningyein pee nu nati, sɛ ebie nze na odi mvomsoɛ a, ɔkora nwu ye anwunvo paa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Ɛhene ati, odikyɛ ɔbɔ afɔleɛ pata ye bɔbɔ ye bɔne, ɔne maen ne bɔne. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa sɔ nidie ne ma ye bɔbɔ ye nwo ɔ; mmom onya sɔ nidie ne, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ afrɛ ye, kyɛbɔ ɔfrɛle Aaron ne.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Sɔ ala yeɛ Kristo bɔbɔ anhyɛ ye nwo anuonyam kyɛ ɔbaayɛ sɔfo panyi, mmom bɔ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛte mma, na ɛnɛ me koso, mayɛ wɔ Baba” ne, ye yeɛ ɔhyɛle ye anuonyam ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Na Nyameɛ sa hane ye wɔ nekaa foforɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Ɛte sɔfo daa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">te kyɛ Melkisedek.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu wɔ aseɛ he aso ne, ɔfale esue ne moen teane nu fale ye mbaeɛ ne ye dwirɛ tole bɔ ɔkɔhora kole ye kofi ewue nu ne nyunu, na ɔnate kyɛ osuro Nyameɛ nati, otiele ye. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ né ɔte Baa, nakoso osuane sotie fili amaneɛ bɔ onwuni ye nanu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Na bɛmaa ɔyɛle pɛ ne, ɔɔyɛle ebie bɔ bɛ bɔ betie ye namukoraati nate ye so konya ngoa daa, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />na Nyameɛ amaa waayɛ sɔfo panyi te kyɛ Melkisedek.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Yɛle ye nwo dwirɛ pee yɛka, nakoso ɔyɛ se kyɛ yɛkohyirehyire nu, ofikyɛ ɔkyɛ kora ne ɛmɔ ate edwirɛ bo. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ɔbaadwu bekye de, ahaa ɛmɔte akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ, nakoso sana ebie sa hyɛ yebo kyirekyire ɛmɔ Nyameɛ dwirɛ nanu nningyein mmaa-mmaa ne bieku. Yeti, ɛmɔtɛ́ hia nyɔfonesue, nná aleɛ bɔ ɔyɛ se. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ebiala bɔ ɔtɛ́ no nyɔfone ne, ɔte akwalaa, ofikyɛ tenenee nwo nimdeɛ bɔ ole ye ne te kaa. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ banyi ne de, aleɛ bɔ ɔyɛ se yeɛ bɛdi ɔ, bɛ de batete b'adwene maa ɔkora nwu nzonzonyɛ bɔ ɔwɔ pa ne tɛɛ nu.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ɛhene ati, Kristo nwo nningyein bɔ yɛli moa yɛsuane ne, kesaalae de yatra berɛ, yeti ɛmɔma yɛyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔkɔmaa yɛ nwo kɔkokwa. Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa yɛto fapem foforɛ yɛma nningyein bɔ ye nwo nhia nwo adwene-sakra ne Nyameɛ nu gyidie, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />asubɔ ahoroɛ nwo ngyerɛkyerɛ ne asaa bɔ bɛfa bɛgua mmenia so, awufo bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ ne daa atemmuo. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ɛhe yeɛ sɛ Nyameɛ ma ye nwo atee a, yɛkɔyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Na bɛ bɔ banwu kanea né le, banya anwuro akyɛdeɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛma mbaen ne bie, banya honhom krongron ne bie, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />banwu Nyameɛ dwirɛ bɔ ɔte pa ne né tumi bɔ ɔwɔ wiase foforɛ bɔ ɔba nanu, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />bɔ bahwe bɛ nwo ne, ɔkɔyɛ se kyɛ bɛkosa bɛkɔmaa bɛkɔsakra b'adwene bieku; ofikyɛ basa babɔ Nyameɛ Awa ne asɛnnua nu bama bɛ nwo, na bagua ye nyunu ase wɔ mmenia nu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ofikyɛ sɛ aseɛ konya nhyira kofi Nyameɛ berɛ a, sana ɔno nzue bɔ ɔtaa tɔ gua so ne, na ofifi mmaa bɔ mvasoɛ wɔ so ma bɛ bɔ bɛluale ne. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Nakoso sɛ ofifi mmowie ne ɛfone de a, ye de mvasoɛ biala nne ye so, na ɔngɔhyɛ né badome ye, na ye awieɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛkɔfa see bɛkɔyera ye.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Nakoso aliemaa mɔ, sɛ yɛka sɔ po a, ɛmɔ de, yɛle ahotɔsoɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ nningyein pa, nningyein bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konya ngoa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ de, ɔtte ase asisie kyɛ ye wora kofi ɛmɔ adwuma, ɔne ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔda ye ali bɛkyire ye dumaa ne, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔsõ akrongronfoɛ, ná ɛmɔtɛ́ so bɛ ne.<verse eid="HEB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Nakoso yɛpena kyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala kɔ so bɔ ye nwo mmɔden sɔ ala, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔfa ahotɔsoɛ bɛkɔnea ɛmɔ anidasoɛ né atee koodwu kyɛ ɔkɔwa nu, <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />ná ɛmɔ anyɛ akwadworɔ, na mmom ɛmɔ asuesua bɛ bɔ bɛnate gyidie ne aboterɛ so nyane bɔhyɛ ne.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ hyɛle Abraham bɔ ne, ɔnate kyɛ né ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte piri tra ye bɔ ɔkɔta ye ndaen nati, ɔtale ye bɔbɔ ye nwo ndaen <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />kyɛ: “Kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ngohyira wɔ, na kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ngɔmaa wɔ bosofoɛ kɔyɛ pee.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ Abraham nyane aboterɛ ne, ye sa hane sɔ bɔhyɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Sɛ sona ta ndaen a, ɔta ebie bɔ ɔte piri tra ye ndaen, na ndaen ne maa nikye biala bo pɛ, ofikyɛ odi edwirɛ nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Sɔ ala yeɛ Nyameɛ koso, mmerɛ bɔ ɔma bɛ bɔ bekonya bɔhyɛ ne nwu ye kyɛ, ye atirimbɔ ne ngɔsesa lle ne, ɔtale ndaen fa foale so. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Yeti ɔnate sɔ nningyein nyɔ bɔ ɔnzesa, bɔ Nyameɛ ngɔhora ngɔpɛ ye nwo anoanu lle nati, yɛ bɔ yanwati yaatoa ye ne, yanya nguraenhyɛ bɔ enu yɛ se, bɔ ɔkɔmaa yɛkɔsɔ y'anidasoɛ nanu yé ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Na anidasoɛ bɔ yɛle ye ne, ɔte kyɛ sɛkyɛ bɔ otira yɛ kra nu, otimu berɛ, na onhinhim. Na sɔ anidasoɛ ne aworo <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> nanu ahɔ krongron nu krongron berɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />nekaa bɔ Yesu ali moa ahɔ berɛ ama yɛ, ná waayɛ sɔfo panyi bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa te kyɛ Melkisedek ne.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Né sɔ Melkisedek ne te Salem hene, na ne osa te Anwuro-Anwuro Nyameɛ ne sɔfo. Mmerɛ bɔ Abraham huni ahemvo nemɔ, na ɔba ne, ooyiale ye, na ohyirale ye, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />na Abraham hyɛle nikye biala nu buru mane ye kõ. Bɔ oli moa ne, ye dumaa ne bo kyire “Tenenee Hene,” afei ɔte Salem hene, bɔ okyire “Asomdwie Hene.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Olle maame, olle baba, na olle abusua biala. Olle ahyɛaseɛ, na olle awieɛ koso, ɔte kyɛ Nyameɛ awa ne, yeti ɔte sɔfo daa.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ osi te sona titire ɔ; nningyein pa bɔ Abusua-panyin Abraham nyane ye wɔ koɛ nanu ne, ɔhyɛle nu buru mane ye kõ. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmeraa ne ama Lewi mmaa mmrienzua bɔ bɛte asɔfo ne ahyɛdeɛ kyɛ, bɛle taet bɛfi bɛ liema Israelfoɛ nemɔ berɛ; ɔwɔ nu, bɛ koso bɛte Abraham bosofoɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Nakoso sɔ biaa he bɔ ɔtte b'abusuaniɛ né lɛle taet fili Abraham berɛ, na ohyirale bɔ bahyɛ ye bɔ ne. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Na aporowaa biala nne ye nwo kyɛ, bɔ ɔte piri ne yeɛ ohyira bɔ ɔte kaa ne ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Lewifoɛ nemɔ afa nu de, bɛ bɔ bedɛ taet ne, né bɛte mmenia bɔ bewu, nakoso Melkisedek deɛ ne de, ebie bɔ bali ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ ɔte ase daa yeɛ odɛ́ taet ne ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Na sɛ yɛkɔha a, Lewi bɔ odɛ́ taet ne po, ɔnate Abraham so tuale taet. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ Melkisedek yiale Abraham ne, ne ɔwɔ ye nana ne mogya nu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Bɛnate Lewi asɔfodie naso yeɛ bɛfale mmeraa ne bɛmane Israelfoɛ ne ɔ. Na sɛ Lewi asɔfodie ne maa sona yɛle pɛ a, ye de, nzuati yeɛ ne ye nwo hia kyɛ benya sɔfo foforɛ te kyɛ Melkisedek, na mmom ɔtte kyɛ Aaron ɔ? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Na ɔnate kyɛ bɛsesã asɔfodie nati, odikyɛ bɛsesã Mmeraa ne koso. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Na sona bɔ sɔ dwirɛ he fa ye nwo ne, ofi abusuakue foforɛ ne, na sɔ abusua ne, bɛ nu biala anyɛ adwuma wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea nanwo lle. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Ebiala se ye pefee kyɛ y'Awurade fi Yuda abusua nu, na Mose koso anga ye lle kyɛ, ebie kofi sɔ abusua nanu kɔɔyɛ sɔfo.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Bɔ ɔma edwirɛ nanu da berɛ paa yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɔfo foforɛ adwɔso bɔ ɔte kyɛ Melkisedek. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ye de, nná abusua bɔ ofi nu yeɛ ɔmaa ɔbayɛ sɔfo kyɛbɔ bahyehyɛ ye wɔ mmeraa nanu ne, na mmom ɔnate ngoa bɔ ɔnzɛkye ne tumi so. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ofikyɛ bali ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“Ɛte sɔfo daa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">te kyɛ Melkisedek.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Yeti, bafa mmeraa daa ne bato nekaa bie, ofikyɛ ɔtɔ si, na mvasoɛ nne so. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Ofikyɛ mmeraa ne amma nikye fee anni mu, na mmom anidasoɛ pa bɔ ɔwale ne yeɛ ɔmaa nikye biala lili mu ɔ, na yɛnate ɛhene aso yeɛ yɛpingye Nyameɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Na ɛhe anu biala ne, né ndaen boka so. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />(Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiemɔ yɛle sɔfo bɔ banga bɛ nwo ndaen, nakoso ɛhe de, bɛhane ye nwo ndaen kora yeɛ ɔbaayɛ sɔfo ɔ, na bɔ ɔhane ndaen ne hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Awurade ata ndaen, na ɔngɔsesa ye adwene. Ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Ɛte sɔfo daa.’ ”)<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Sɔ ndaen he ti, bafa Yesu bali agyinam bama apam bɔ odi mu tra ɛhene ne. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Afei koso, mmeni pee yeɛ ne odikyɛ bɛdi sɔfo ɔ, ofikyɛ ne ewue mma bɛngora bɛndoa so benni sɔfo ne daa, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />nakoso Yesu de, ɔnate kyɛ ɔte ase daa nati, ebiala ngoli ye bia kyɛ sɔfo. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛfa ye so bɛba Nyameɛ berɛ ne, ɔkora dɛ́ bɛ koraa, ofikyɛ ɔte ase daa, na ɔsrɛ ma bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Sɛ yɛnya sɔfo panyi bie sɔa a, ɔte kama paa; ofikyɛ ye de, ɔte krongron, edwirɛ nne ye nwo, ɛfiɛ nne ye nwo, baye ye bafi abɔnefoɛ nu, na bama ye so batra anwuro po. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Ye de, ɔtte kyɛ sɔ sɔfo mbanyi bɔ ne odikyɛ daa biala bɛbɔ afɔleɛ bɛpata bɛ bɔne kora ne babɔ bie bama maen ne, ofikyɛ ye de ɔbɔle afɔleɛ ne komapɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɔfale ye nwo bɔle afɔleɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Afei, mmenia bɔ bɛyɛ mmerɛ yeɛ ne mmeraa ne ye bɛ maa bɛbayɛ sɔfo ɔ, nakoso ndaen bɔ ɔwale mmeraa ne si ne de, ɔyele Baa bɔ bamaa wayɛ pɛ koraa.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Bɔ yɛka namukoraati ne, bɔ yɛpena yɛkyire yeɛ ole kyɛ: Yɛle sɔfo panyi bie sɔ, na ɔte Otumvoɛ né bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ, “Ɔhene bia” anaa “Ahemvo bia.”</char></note> ne famaa so wɔ anwuro, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />ná ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ nekaa krongron berɛ ne <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nanu. Sɔ tɛnt ne, nná sona yeɛ osili ɔ, mmom Awurade bɔbɔ yeɛ osili ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Bɛye sɔfo panyi biala kyɛ ɔfa akyɛdeɛ ma, na ɔbɔ afɔleɛ; yeti ɛhe koso, odikyɛ ɔfa nikye bie bɔ afɔleɛ. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Sɛ ɔwɔ aseɛ so a, ahaa ɔngɔyɛ sɔfo po, ofikyɛ asɔfo wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛfa akyɛdeɛ bɛma kyɛbɔ mmeraa né kyire ne. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Adwuma bɔ sɔ mmrienzua nemɔ yɛ ne, ɔte kyɛ bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne pɛpɛɛpɛ, ɔte ye wawoɛ. Sɔ ala yeɛ Mose koso, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɔbaasi tɛnt ne, Nyameɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea kyɛ ɛkɔyɛ nikye biala pɛpɛɛpɛ te kyɛ bɔ mva ngyirele wɔ wɔ bokaa naso ne.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Nakoso kesaalae de, Kristo sa aha sɔfodwuma bɔ odi mu koraa tra bɛ deɛ ne, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ apam bɔ odi mu ne gyi ye so ɔ; na sɔ apam ne, ogyi bɔhyɛ ahoroɛ bɔ odi mu so. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Sɛ ne edwirɛ nne apam bɔ oli moa nanwo a, ahaa ye nwo nhia kyɛ bɛyɛ apam bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Nakoso onwuni mvomsoɛ wɔ mmenia nanwo, yeti yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“ ‘Ɛmɔtie, ngyẽa bie ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">na mene Israel awuro ne Yuda awuro kɔyɛ apam foforɛ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Awurade yeɛ waha ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />‘Ɔngɔyɛ kyɛ apam bɔ mene bɛ nana mɔ yɛle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">mmerɛ bɔ nzosɔle bɛ sa nyele bɛ mvili Egypt aseɛ so ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ofikyɛ banni me apam naso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">yeti me koso nyele me nye mmane bɛ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Awurade noa dwirɛ ɛne.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />‘Mmom apam he yeɛ mene Israel awuro kɔyɛ ye wɔ ngyẽa ne si ɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Awurade noa dwirɛ ɛne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">‘Ngɔfa me mmeraa ngowura bɛ ti anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na mahworɔ magua b'ahone nu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Na ngɔyɛ bɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na bɛ koso bayɛ me maen.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Na bɛ nu biala ngohyire ye mmango anaa oliema kõ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">“Nwu Awurade,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">ofikyɛ bɛ mukoraati, ofi akwalaa so bɔ ɔkwaadwu panyi so ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ebiala konwu me.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Na ngonwu bɛ awunvoin wɔ bɛ amumuyɛɛ nwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">na bɛ bɔne koso, mengɔkaye ye kõ.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane “apam foforɛ” ne, okyire kyɛ apam bɔ oli moa ne ayɛ daa. Na nikye biala bɔ wayɛ daa, ná ɔpɛ nu ne, ɔngɔhyɛ okomini.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Apam bɔ oli moa ne, né ole ɔsom nwo mmeraa, na ne ole nekaa krongron wɔ aseɛ he aso. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Na bɛsili <char style="w">tɛnt</char>, ye sua bɔ oli moa ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ né kanea bakaa, tɛbulu, ne paanoo bɔ bɛfa bɛba Nyameɛ nyunu ne wɔ ɔ. Na ne bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ Nekaa Krongron. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Né sua foforɛ wɔ <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne si, na ne bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ Krongron Nu Krongron. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ ne sikaa kɔkorɛ afɔleɛ bokyea bɔ bɛyera insɛns wɔ so, ɔne apam alaka bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ bafa ye nwo mukoraati ne gyi ɔ. Na ne sikaa kɔkorɛ kwangoa bɔ mana wɔ nu, Aaron pɔmaa bɔ ofifili, ɔne apam nanwo nyɔboɛ nyɔ ne gua apam alaka nanu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Né kerubim bɔ bɛle anuonyam ne butu-butu mbata tire bɔ ɔkata alaka naso ne aso; nakoso nná kesaalae yeɛ yɛbaaha sɔ nningyein hemɔ nwo dwirɛ yɛkɔ siɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛyɛle nikye biala kama sɔ ne, ne asɔfo nemɔ kɔ tɛnt né sua bɔ oli moa nanu daa bɛkɔyɛ b'adwuma krongron ne. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Nakoso sua bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne de, sɔfo panyi ne ngome yeɛ ne ɔkɔ berɛ ɔ, na afoɛ biala, né ɔkɔ berɛ komapɛ. Ɔkɔ biala a, ne odikyɛ ɔfa mogya bɔ ɔkɔfa kɔbɔ ye bɔbɔ ye bɔne nwo afɔleɛ, ɔne bɔne bɔ mmenia ne ayɛ bɔ bɛnze nanwo afɔleɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Honhom krongron ne maa yɛnwu ye pefee kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ tɛnt bɔ oli moa ne tɛ́ wɔ berɛ ne, atee bɔ ɔkɔ Krongron Nu Krongron berɛ ne, bamma yannwu ye. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Sɔ tɛnt ne maa yɛnwu bɔ ne ɔkɔhɔ so ɛnɛ ɔ, ofikyɛ akyɛdeɛ ne afɔleɛ bɔ bɛbɔle ne, wangora wamma bɔ ɔsõ Nyameɛ ne ahonim anni mu. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Bɔ ne ɔfa ye nwo ala yeɛ ole aleɛ, anonneɛ, ne asubɔ ahoroɛ; né ɛhemɔ te anwoɔnaen nu nziesie bɔ ne odikyɛ bɛyɛ alaa kodwu kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bahyɛ kyɛ bɛkɔ toto nningyein yé ne koso ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ Kristo wale kyɛ nningyein pa bɔ wawa nanwo sɔfo panyi ne, owurale tɛnt bɔ ɔte piri, na odi mu tra daa deɛ nanu. Sɔ tɛnt ne, nná sona yeɛ osili ɔ, na ɔbokka sɔ abɔdeɛ he aso. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Ɔhɔle krongron nu krongron berɛ komapɛ, nakoso nná mmɔngye ne nandwie mogya yeɛ ɔfa hɔle ɔ, mmom, ɔfale ye bɔbɔ ye mogya, yeti wanya ngoa bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa wama yɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Na sɛ né bɛfa mmɔngye ne nandwie nyii mogya, ne nandwie bereɛ nzoen bɛpete bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo agua fiɛ nanwo maa bɛ nwo te, na ɔmaa bɛ nipadua nanwo te a, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />ye de Kristo bɔ ɔnate honhom bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa naso fale ye nwo mane Nyameɛ kyɛ afɔleɛ bɔ ɛfiɛ biala nne ye nwo ne, nzuati yeɛ ye mogya ne ngɔhora ngɔte yɛ ahonim nwo ngofi nneyɛɛ basa-basa nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛkɔsõ Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne ɔ?<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Yeti, Kristo yeɛ apam foforɛ ne gyi ye so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bafrɛ bɛ ne konya agyapadeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa nanwo bɔhyɛ ne. Bɔ wamaa ɛhe ayɛ yé yeɛ ole kyɛ, wawu wafa wale bɛ wafi bɔne bɔ bɛyɛle ye wɔ apam bɔ oli moa ne bo nanu.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Sɛ ebie yɛ <char style="tl">will</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nzamanzeɛ.”</char></note> a, odikyɛ sona bɔ ɔyɛle <char style="tl">will</char> ne wu, <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />ofikyɛ sɛ sona ne wulli a, ye <char style="tl">will</char><note caller="⁺" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nzamanzeɛ”</char></note> ne nnyɛ adwuma, sana wawu kora. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Yeti, apam bɔ oli moa ne, sɛ mogya amma nu a, ahaa wanyɛ adwuma. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ Mose kengale mmera nanu dwirɛ mukoraati yiele ne, ɔfale nandwie ne mmɔngye né mogya, afei ɔfale nzue, koogyan, ne sommɛ, ná ɔfa petene nwomaa ne né mmenia nemɔ so <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />hane kyɛ: “Apam bɔ Nyameɛ ahyɛ kyɛ ɛmɔli so ne, ye nwo mogya ɛhe.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔfale mogya petene tɛnt ne, ɔne nningyein bɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ adwuma krongron namukoraati so. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Kyɛbɔ mmeraa ne kyire ne, odikyɛ bɛfa mogya bɛte nikye biala nwo, na sɛ mogya angua a, bɔne-fakyɛ nne berɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Yeti, nningyein bɔ osoma nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, né odikyɛ bɛfa sɔ atee nala so bɛte ye nwo; nakoso anwuro deɛ nemɔ de, afɔleɛ bɔ odi mu tra so yeɛ bɛfa bɛte bɛ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Nná nekaa krongron bɔ sona ayɛ, bɔ wayɛ kyɛ anwuro deɛ nanu yeɛ Kristo hɔle ɔ, mmom ɔhɔle anwuro deinn, na kesaalae wafa ye nwo waahyire Nyameɛ wama yɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Wangɔ kyɛ ɔkwaafa ye nwo bɔ afɔleɛ daa, kyɛbɔ ne sɔfo panyi ne fa ebie mogya kɔ krongron nu krongron berɛ afoɛ biala ne. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Ye sɔ de a, ahaa odikyɛ Kristo kɔ so ala nwu amaneɛ fi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle wiase ne. Mmom kesaalae, waye ye nwo ali komapɛ wɔ wiase né awieɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔnate ye nwo bɔ ɔfa bɔle afɔleɛ naso kɔye bɔne kofi berɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kyɛbɔ odikyɛ sona wu komapɛ, ná ewue ne si ne, atemmuo yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ne, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />sɔ ala yeɛ bɛfale Kristo bɛbɔle afɔleɛ komapɛ maa ɔsoale mmeni pee bɔne; na okosa kɔwa bieku, sɔ mmerɛ ne de, nná bɔne yeɛ ɔbaasoa ɔ, mmom, ɔbaale bɛ bɔ bɛyere bɛ nwo bɛnwondɛ ye ne ngoa.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Né mmeraa ne te nningyein pa bɔ ɔkɔwa ne wawoɛ, ná ɔtte nningyein ne deinn. Yeti sɔ afɔleɛ bɔ ne bɛbɔ ye afoɛ-afoɛ ne, ne ɔngɔhora ngɔma bɛ bɔ bɛba Nyameɛ berɛ ne ngoli mu. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Sɛ ɔhora yɛle sɔ a, ahaa ye de bɛyakyile afɔleɛ ne bɔlɛ. Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ ne, sɛ benya bɛte bɛ nwo a, b'ahonim mmu bɛ fɔ kõ. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Mmom, né sɔ afɔleɛ ne maa bɛkaye bɛ bɔne ne afoɛ biala, <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />ofikyɛ nandwie ne mmɔngye mogya ngɔhora ngɔye bɔne ngofi berɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ Kristo wale wiase ne, ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Afɔleɛ ne akyɛdeɛ de, né ɛnguro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">mmom, asiesie nipadua ama me.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ɛyeralɛ afɔleɛ ne bɔne nwo afɔleɛ koso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">né wɔ nye ngye ye nwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Yeɛ ngane kyɛ, ‘Me ɛhe, bahworɔ me nwo dwirɛ wɔ nwomaa nanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">O Nyameɛ, mawa kyɛ mebaayɛ bɔ ɛkuro ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Oli moa hane kyɛ: “Né ɛnguro afɔleɛ ne akyɛdeɛ, na ne wɔ ngye ɛyeralɛ afɔleɛ ne bɔne nwo afɔleɛ nwo,” ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ mmeraa ne yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ bɛbɔ sɔ afɔleɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Yeɛ ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Me ɛhe, mawa kyɛ mebaayɛ bɔ ɛkuro ɔ.” Yeti, ɔyele bɔ oli moa ne fili berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔfa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne kosie berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Na ɔnate bɔ okuro he aso afa Yesu Kristo nipadua bɔ ɔfa bɔle afɔleɛ komapɛ naso ate yɛ mukoraati nwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Daa biala, sɔfo biala gyina ye gya so yɛ y'adwuma, na ɔbɔ afɔleɛ komapɛ nala mmerɛ pee; nakoso sɔ afɔleɛ ne, ɔngora nnye bɔne mvi berɛ koraa. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Nakoso Kristo de, ɔbɔle sɔ bɔne nwo afɔleɛ ne pɛenko, na ɔɔtenane Nyameɛ sa famaa so, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />na kesaalae, ɔnwondɛ kyɛ, bɛkɔfa ye atamfo bɛkogua ye gya bo. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Na ɔnate afɔleɛ komapɛ bɔ ɔbɔle naso amaa bɛ bɔ bate bɛ nwo ne ayɛ pɛ koraa. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Honhom krongron ne koso di ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ. Bɔ oli moa ne, ɔka kyɛ:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“ ‘Apam he yeɛ mene bɛ kɔyɛ ye wɔ ngyẽa ne si ɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">Awurade noa dwirɛ ɛne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Ngɔfa me mmeraa ngowura b'ahone nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">na mahworɔ magua bɛ ti anu.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Yeɛ osa toale so kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Mengɔkaye bɛ bɔne ne bɛ amumuyɛɛ né kõ.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Na sɛ bɛfa ɛhemɔ bɛkyɛ a, ye nwo nhia kyɛ bɛbɔ bɔne nwo afɔleɛ kõ.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, Yesu mogya ne amaa yanya ahotɔsoɛ kyɛ yɛkɔhɔ krongron nu krongron berɛ; <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />ofikyɛ wabukye ngoa atee foforɛ wato <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> nanu wama yɛ, kɛtens ne yeɛ ole ye nipadua ne. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Na ɔnate kyɛ yɛle sɔfo panyi bɔ ɔnea Nyameɛ awuro so nati, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />ɛmɔma yɛfa ahone bɔ enu te, ɔne gyidie bɔ odi mu yɛbra, ofikyɛ bate y'ahone nwo bafi ahonim<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tiboa.”</char></note> tɛɛ biala nwo, na bafa nzue gyengɔɔ banwunzi yɛ nipadua nwo. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Ɛmɔma yɛsɔ anidasoɛ bɔ yɛka ye nwo dwirɛ nanu pindinn, ofikyɛ bɔ wahyɛ yɛ bɔ ne, ɔte ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Na ɛmɔma yɛ nu biala dwene ye mmango nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yekonwu atee bɔ yɛkɔfa so yɛkɔhyɛ ebiala nguraen maa ɔkɔla ɔdɔ ali na wayɛ nyumaa pa; <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />nnɛmɔ maa yɛyakyi kyɛ yɛne yɛ nwo koyia nu, kyɛbɔ ebiemɔ ayakyi ne, mmom ɛmɔma yɛhyehyɛ yɛ nwo nguraen, ɛnga-nga kesaalae bɔ yanwu ye kyɛ ngyẽa né pingye ne.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Sɛ yɛnya nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ yɛ yie, na yɛhyɛda yɛtena bɔne nu a, ye de bɔne nwo afɔleɛ biala nne berɛ kõ, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />mmom bɔ odikyɛ yɛnea ye atee ala yeɛ ole atemmuo bɔ ɔyɛ suro, ɔne ɛyaa bɔ yenoa yɛ se bɔ ɔbaafa sɛkye ye atamfo ne. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Sɛ ebie bu Mose mmeraa ne animtia a, begyina mmenia nyɔ anaa nza adanzeɛ so beku ye bɔ bɛnnwu ye anwunvo ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Ye de, sɛ ebie tietia Nyameɛ Awa ne nyunu, ogua apam mogya bɔ bɛfa bɛtele ye nwo nanwo fiɛ, na ɔpepɛ adom honhom ne nzoaa a, asotwe beni yeɛ ɛnea ɔfata sɔ sona ne ɔ? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Bɔ ɔhane kyɛ: “Me yeɛ metua bɔne so kerɛ; ngotua so kerɛ,” na osa hane kyɛ: “Awurade kobu ye maen atɛn ne,” yɛse ye. <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Na ɔyɛ suro paa kyɛ, ɛkɔtɔ Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne ngaen nu ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Ɛmɔkaye mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔli moa bɛnwuni kanea ne; sɔ mmerɛ ne, ɛmɔ miane ɛmɔ nye bɛfale ɔhaw pee nu. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Ɔtɔ mmerɛ bie a, né bɛgua ɛmɔ nyunu ase, na ne bɛteetee ɛmɔ wɔ badwanu; ɔtɔ mmerɛ bie koso a, né ɛmɔ bata bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ bɛ sɔ nanwo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Ɛmɔnwuni bɛ bɔ bɛla prizin ne anwunvo, na sɛ bɛfẽ ɛmɔ nwo nningyein po a, né ɛmɔfa anigye bɛpene so, ofikyɛ né ɛmɔse kyɛ ɛmɔle agyapadeɛ pa bie bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Yeti, ahotɔsoɛ bɔ ne ɛmɔle ye ne, nnɛmɔ yakyi nu, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ konya ye nwo akatua paa. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Odikyɛ ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye begyina nu, na sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ne beyie a, ɛmɔ konya bɔ ɔfa hyɛle ɛmɔ bɔ ne. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ofikyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Waha kaa bie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">né bɔ ɔba ne adwu, na ɔngɔhyɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Na me teneneeniɛ de, gyidie yeɛ ɔkɔmaa okonya ngoa ɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">sɛ osa yesi a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">me nye ngɔgye ye nwo kõ.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Nakoso yɛ de, yɛtte mmenia bɔ besa bɛ si maa bɛsɛkye bɛ; mmom yɛte mmenia bɔ yɛle gyidie bɔ odɛ́ yɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “yɛ kra.”</char></note> ngoa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Gyidie te ahotɔsoɛ bɔ yɛle ye kyɛ, nningyein bɔ yɛ nye la so ne kɔwa nu; ɔte adanzeɛ pefee bɔ okyire kyɛ, nningyein bɔ yɛnnwu ye ne wɔ berɛ paa. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Ɛhene yeɛ ɔmaa bɛlili tetefoɛ nemɔ nwo adanzeɛ ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu ye kyɛ, ɔnate Nyameɛ dwirɛ so yeɛ bɛyɛle wiase ne ɔ, yeti nningyein bɔ yɛnwu ye ne, ofi nningyein bɔ yɛnnwu ye nanu yeɛ ɔwale ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa Habel bɔle afɔleɛ bɔ odi mu trale Kain deɛ ne. Na ɔnate sɔ gyidie naso ne, bɛlili ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ lɛle ye akyɛdeɛ ne tole nu. Na ɔwɔ nu, wawu de, nakoso ɔnate ye gyidie naso dwudwo.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Gyidie ti, bɛfale Enok bɛhɔle nekaa foforɛ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔngonwu ewue ɔ, na bannwu ye wɔ nekafee, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ fale ye fili nekaa bɔ né ɔwɔ ne. Na kora bɔ bɛfa ye ne, bɛlili ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ wayɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Sɛ ebie lle gyidie a, ɔngɔhora ngɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye, ofikyɛ, odikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔba Nyameɛ berɛ ne nya gyidie kyɛ ɔwɔ berɛ, na otua bɛ bɔ bɛ nye aboro bɛpena ye ne kerɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Gyidie ti, mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle Nowa kɔkɔ wɔ nningyein bɔ onya nwuni ye nanwo ne, otiele na ɔyɛle alaka bɔ ɔkɔfa kole ye abusua ne ngoa; ofikyɛ né osuro Nyameɛ. Na ɔnate sɔ gyidie naso buli wiase ne fɔ, na ye gyidie ti, bɛnwuni ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Gyidie ti, mmerɛ bɔ bɛfrɛle Abraham ne, otiele, na ɔhɔle nekaa bɔ né okonya ye kyẽabie kyɛ ye agyapadeɛ ne; ɔhɔle, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ né ɔnze nekaa bɔ ɔkɔ ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa ɔtenane bɔhyɛ aseɛ naso te kyɛ ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ ɔte ebie maen so ne. Na ɔne Isaac ne Yakob bɔ bɛ koso bekonya sɔ bɔhyɛ nala bie ne tenane <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nu. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ofikyɛ ne ɔnea kuro bɔ ye fapem yɛ se ne atee. Sɔ kuro ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔhyehyɛle ɔ, na ye yeɛ osili ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Gyidie ti, Sara nyane anwoserɛ fa nwonzɛle wole baa, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ né wabo aworɛ so ne, ofikyɛ obuli bɔ ɔhyɛle bɔ ne kyɛ ɔte ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ɛhe ati, ɔnate brienzua kõ bɔ ne wawu wayie naso nyane mmaa pee bɔ bɛ dodoɔ te kyɛ anwuro nzramaa, ne ɛpo noa anweaa bɔ olle ye noa.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Gyidie nu yeɛ sɔ mmenia hemɔ mukoraati wuli ɔ. Ɔwɔ nu, bɛ sa anga bɔhyɛ ne, nakoso bɛnwuni ye wɔ dede, na bɛfale anigye bɛle bɛtole nu. Na bɛle bɛtole nu kyɛ, bɛte ɛwɔfoɛ ne amanfrafoɛ wɔ aseɛ naso. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Bɛ bɔ bɛka sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɔ okyire yɛ ole kyɛ bɛ nye aboro bɛpena bɛ bɔbɔ bɛ deɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Na sɛ bɛhɔle so bɛdwenene maen bɔ bɛtu bɛfili nu nanwo a, ahaa benyane atee besa bɛhɔle. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Nakoso kesaalae de, bɛpena nekaa bɔ ɔte pa, kyire kyɛ, nekaa bɔ ofi anwuro. Yeti, ɔnyɛ Nyameɛ fɛle kyɛ bɛkɔfrɛ ye bɛ Nyameɛ, ofikyɛ wasiesie kuro bie wama bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Gyidie ti, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ sɔle Abraham neane ne, ɔhale sɔa, ahaa ɔfale ɔwa brienzua Isaac bɔle afɔleɛ. Biaa bɔ ne wale bɔhyɛ ne wato nu ne, ɔyɛle ye adwene kyɛ ɔfa ɔwa komapɛ ne bɔ afɔleɛ <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ne baha bahyire ye kyɛ: “Bɔ bɛkɔfrɛ ye wɔ bosoniɛ ne, ɔnate Isaac so yeɛ ɔkɔwa” ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Nakoso onyane adwene kyɛ, Nyameɛ kɔhora kotingye ye kofi ewue nu, na atee bie so ne, ye sa hane ye.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa Isaac hyirale Yakob ne Esau wɔ nningyein bɔ ne ɔkɔwa nu kyẽabie nanwo ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Gyidie ti, Yakob baawu ne, ohyirale Yosef mmaa mmrienzua nemɔ, na obutuli ye pɔmaa naso sone ye.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Gyidie ti, ɔka kaa maa Yosef wu ne, ɔhane Israel mmaa bɔ bɛkɔtu bɛkofi Egypt nanwo dwirɛ, na ye mmowie koso ohyirele bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ye ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Gyidie ti Mose aworɛ si ne, ye awofo fale ye siele bosome nza; ofikyɛ bɛnwuni kyɛ akwalaa ne nwo yɛ nyemene, na banzuro ɔhene ne mmeraa ne.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Gyidie ti yeɛ Mose nyini ne, wamma bamvrɛ ye Farao awa brasua awa ne, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />mmom né okuro kyɛ ɔne Nyameɛ mmenia nwu amaneɛ tra kyɛ okoli fɛɛ wɔ bɔne nu mmerɛ kaa bie. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Na onwuni kyɛ sɛ Kristo ti bɛgua ye nyunu ase a, mvasoɛ wɔ so tra kyɛ ekonya Egypt ahonyadeɛ, ofikyɛ né ye nye la akatua bɔ okonya ye kyẽabie naso.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa ofili Egypt bɔ wanzuro ɔhene ne yaa ne, na ogyinane pindinn te kyɛ ɛnwa onwu Ɛdangama bɔ bɛnnwu ye ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Gyidie ti olili Pɛnu ne, na ɔfale mogya petene ye anoa nanwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a sɛkyefoɛ ne ngɔha bɛ piesie nemɔ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Gyidie ti, Israelfoɛ ne fale ɛpo kɔkorɛ nanu te kyɛ ɛnwa bɛnate aseɛ kesee so, na mmerɛ bɔ Egyptfoɛ né pena kyɛ bɛyɛ bie ne, nzue ne fale bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa Yeriko fasue ne dwiri guale, mmerɛ bɔ Israelfoɛ ne fale ɛlɛsoo pɛle ye nwo yiale ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ná gyidie ti, bangu tuutuuniɛ Rahab bammoka asoserɛfoɛ naso, ofikyɛ olɛle bɛ bɔ bɛwale kyɛ bɛbaatetɛ kuro ne kama.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Nzu bieku po yeɛ nga ɔ? Sɛ menwa meka Gideon, Barak, Samson, Yefta, David, Samuel ne adiifoɛ bɔ baha nanwo dwirɛ a, ahaa mengoyie. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Bɛ yeɛ ɔnate gyidie ti, bɛlili ahennie ahoroɛ so ngunim, bɛmaa atɛn tenenee yɛle adwuma, benyane bɔhyɛ ahoroɛ, bɛsili gyata mɔ noa, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bɛnuane see bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru, bɛnwati bɛfili dadeɛ noa, benyane anwoserɛ ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ne bayɛ mmerɛ, benyane anwoserɛ paa bɛhone ngondii, na bɛfoane sogyafoɛ bɔ bawa bɛ so ne.<verse eid="HEB 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Mmrasua sa hane b'awufo bɔ batingye bafi ewue nu ne, nakoso ebiemɔ de, bɛyɛle bɛ ayayade paa, nakoso bambene maa banyakyi bɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonya ewue tingyele bɔ ɔte pa ne. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Nzɔhwɛ bɔ ebiemɔ yiale yeɛ ole ngorohoɛ ne ɛgwalɛ, ebiemɔ po de, bɛfale kyenyi bɛkyekyele bɛ, na bɛfale bɛ bɛguale prizin. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bɛsili bɛ nyɔboɛ, bɛsɔle bɛ bɛneane, bɛfale sralaa bɛpakyele bɛ nu, bɛfale dadeɛ bɛhuni bɛ, bɛfale mmoan ne mmɔngye nwomaa bɛyɛle ndadeɛ bɛwurale, bɛlili hiaa, bɛnwuni amaneɛ, bɛteeteele bɛ, <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />na ne ewiase po mvata bɛ. Yeti bɛhyinini ɛserɛ ne mmokaa so, ɔne nyɔboɛ bɔ wayɛ sua ne bɔen bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ naso nanu.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ mukoraati, bɛ gyidie ti bɛlili bɛ nwo adanzeɛ pa, nakoso bɔhyɛ ne amma nu maa bannwu ye, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />ofikyɛ Nyameɛ ayɛ nhyehyɛɛ pa ato berɛ ama yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛne bɛ mukoraati kɔbɔ nu kɔyɛ pɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Yeti, ɔnate kyɛ yɛle adanzefoɛ munungum pee bɔ bapɛ yɛ nwo bayia nati, ɛmɔma yɛgyi adesoa biala ne bɔne bɔ ɔngyɛ ne wakyekye yɛ ne yɛgua, na yɛfa animia yɛtu mirika bɔ ɔla yɛ nyunu ne, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />mmerɛ bɔ yɛnea Yesu bɔ ɔte yɛ gyidie farebae, na ɔmaa yɛ gyidie si pi ne. Anigye bɔ ne ɔla ye nyunu nati, onwuni amaneɛ wɔ asɛnnua so, na obuli ye nye guale animguaseɛ so, ná waatena Nyameɛ bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ, “Ɔhene bia” anaa “Ahemvo bia.”</char></note> ne famaa so. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Yeti, ye bɔ omiane ye nye gyinane nzoaa nwora bɔ abɔnefoɛ pepɛle ye ne noa ne, ɛmɔto ɛmɔ bo ase bɛsusu ye nwo, ɛhene kɔmaa ɛmɔ abanu ngobu, ná ɛmɔ wora ngɔbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Na ngondii bɔ ɛmɔ ne bɔne kõ ne, ɛmɔdwulli nekaa bɔ mogya kogua ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Afei, afutuo bɔ bɛfa bɛmane ɛmɔ kyɛ mmaa ne, ɛmɔ wora afi hɔ? Ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mma, sɛ Awurade twe wɔ so a, nnɛbu ye kyɛ ɔte angorɛ bie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">na sɛ otwi wɔ nyunu a, nnɛmaa w'abanu bu.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Ofikyɛ bɔ Awurade dɔ ye ne, yeɛ ɔtwe ye so ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebiala bɔ wafa ye wayɛ ɔwa ne, ogwa ye.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Bɔ ɛmɔfa nu ne, ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye begyina nu, na ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ ɔboka ndeɛsoɛ naso. Nyameɛ twe ɛmɔ so kyɛ ye mmaa mɔ. Na baa beni yeɛ ye baba ndwe ye so ɔ? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Sɛ ɛmɔ annya sɔ ndeɛsoɛ he bie a, ye de, nná ye mma yeɛ ole ɛmɔ, né ɛmɔte adwaman mmaa. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Afei koso, né yɛ baba mɔ bɔ bɛte mmenia ne twe yɛ so, na yɛfa obuo yɛma bɛ. Ye sɔ de a, aso onhia kyɛ yɛbrɛ yɛ nwo ase koraa yɛma yɛ honhom nu Baba ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yekonya ngoa ɔ? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Bɛ de, bɛteane yɛ mmerɛ kaa bie, kyɛbɔ bɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔte paa ma bɛ ne, na ye de, yɛ pa nu ti yeɛ ɔyɛ sɔ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yekonya ye krongron ne bie. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole, kesaalae de, asotwe biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔyɛ fɛ ɔ, mmom ɔyɛ yea; nakoso yesi ne, bɛ bɔ bɛmaa ɔtete bɛ ne, osu asomdwie mmaa bɔ yeɛ ole tenenee ne.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Yeti ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ sa bɔ enu ago, ɔne ɛmɔ nangoroma bɔ wayɛ mmerɛ nanu, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />na ɛmɔfa atee bɔ ɔtengyɛ so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a agyire bɔ ɔttemaye ne ngɔtto ngɔfa ye nwo, mmom okonya ayaresa.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Ɛmɔma asomdwie tena ɛmɔ ne ebiala afia, na ɛmɔbɔ abrabɔ krongron, ofikyɛ sɛ ebie bra anyɛ krongron a, ongonwu Awurade. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Ɛmɔnea yé na sona biala andwe ye nwo amvi Nyameɛ adom nanwo, ná ndii bɔ ɔte pɔizen biala amvifi anha adwene, ná wangua mmeni pee nwo fiɛ; <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />ɛmɔnea yé na ebiala anyɛ adwamammɔniɛ, anaa ebie bɔ olle obuo biala mma nningyein krongron kyɛbɔ Esau yɛle ne. Ye yeɛ aleɛ kõ ti, ɔtɔnene ye nwo atee bɔ ole ye kyɛ baa panyi ne. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Na ɛmɔse kyɛ yesi ne, né ɔpena nhyira, nakoso bɛpole ye; ɔwɔ nu, ɔtele mmoen, na ɔyɛle bɔ ɔkɔhora biala kyɛ ɔkɔmaa ye baba kɔsesa ye adwene, nakoso wanzi aga.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Na ɛmɔ de, bokaa bɔ bɛkora bɛfa bɛ sa bɛka ye, bɔ see la nu, ná nwosina kumɔɔn ne awosii kabii wɔ so, bɔ mvrama kandinga tu fa ye nwo ne, ɛmɔ amma ye nwo; <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />na ɛmɔ amma awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> né dede ne, ɔne konviɛ bɔ enu dwirɛ ne maa bɛ bɔ né betie ne srɛle kyɛ nnɛmaa bɛka edwirɛ biala bɛkyire bɛ kõ nanwo. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Ofikyɛ edwirɛ bɔ bɛhane ne, né yenoa yɛ se ma bɛ, yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Sɛ kaka po nwo ka bokaa ne a, bɛsi ye nyɔboɛ.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Bɔ ne ɔkɔ so ne, né ɔyɛ suro alaa maa Mose po hane kyɛ: “Mesuro, yeti me nwo popo.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Mmom, ɛmɔ awa Zion Bokaa nanwo ne Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne kuro, Yerusalem bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, ɔne abɔfo buburu-gyaa <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />bɔ bayia nu ne nyunu, ɔne mmaa mbanyi bɔ bahworɔ bɛ dumaa wɔ anwuro né asafo nanu, ɔne Nyameɛ bɔ okobu ebiala atɛn ne nyunu, yeɛ teneneefoɛ bɔ bɛfa honhom ne bɛbɔ bɛ bra, bɔ bayɛ pɛ, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />ɔne Yesu bɔ apam foforɛ ne gyi ye so nanwo, ɔne mogya bɔ bɛpete bɔ odwudwo yé tra Habel Mogya ne.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Yeti, ɛmɔnea yé na ɛmɔ annyɛ ɛmɔ adwene kyɛ ɛmɔngotie bɔ odwudwo ne, ofikyɛ bɛbɔ bandie bɔ ɔfale Ɛdangama ne kɔkɔbɔ ne mane bɛ wɔ aseɛ he aso ne, bamva bɛ nwo banni. Na sɛ bamva bɛ nwo banni a, ye de, sɛ yɛkakyi yɛsi yɛkyire bɔ odwudwo fi anwuro ne a, yɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne yafa yɛ nwo yali? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, ye konvi maa aseɛ ne wosole, na kesaalae wahyɛ bɔ kyɛ: “Ngosa ngɔyɛ bieku, nakoso nná aseɛ ngome yeɛ ngɔwoso ye ɔ, ngɔwoso anwuro koso.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhane kyɛ “ngosa ngɔyɛ bieku” ne, okyire kyɛ ɔkɔye nningyein bɔ ɔwosole ne kofi berɛ, kyire kyɛ nningyein bɔ wabɔ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, nningyein bɔ wanwoso ne kɔha berɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ɔnate kyɛ yɛ sa kɔha ahennie bɔ ɔnwoso nati, ɛmɔma yɛfa anisɔ yɛle yɛto nu, na yɛfa esuronyi ne ahopopo yɛsõ Nyameɛ wɔ atee bɔ okuro so, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />“ofikyɛ yɛ Nyameɛ te see bɔ ɔsɛkye nikye.”<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ aliemaa mɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Nnɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nye bɛgua ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ ɛmɔkole bɛ naso, ofikyɛ ebiemɔ nate sɔ atee he aso lɛle abɔfo wale b'awuro bɔ né bɛnze ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Bɛ bɔ bɛla prizin ne, ɛmɔkaye bɛ te kyɛ ɛmɔ ne bɛ yeɛ bɛla berɛ ɔ; na bɛ bɔ bɛteetee bɛ ne, ɛmɔkaye bɛ te kyɛ ɛmɔ ne bɛ yeɛ bɛnwu amaneɛ ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔli agyaa ni, ná nnɛmɔ gua agyaa mba nwo fiɛ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ kobu adwamammɔfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye agyaa ne atɛn. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ nye boro sikaa wɔ ɛmɔ abrabɔ nu lle, mmom ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye sɔ bɔ ɛmɔle ye nala, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ aha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Mengɔyakyi wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">na mengɔ ye me nye mengɔma wɔ lle.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Yeti, yɛkora yɛfa akukuduro yɛka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Awurade te me bokafoɛ, menzuro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Nzu yeɛ dasaniɛ kɔhora kɔyɛ me ɔ?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Ɛmɔkaye bɛ bɔ bɛli ɛmɔ nyunu, bɔ bɛhane Nyameɛ dwirɛ bɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne. Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ b'abrabɔ koyie bɛ, na ɛmɔsuesua bɛ gyidie. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Kyɛbɔ ne Yesu Kristo te anoma ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔte ɛnɛ, ɔne daa ɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Nnɛmɔ maa ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ biala twe ɛmɔ fi atee paa naso, ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ adom kɔhyɛ ahone né nguraen tra kyɛ aleɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aleɛ nwo mmeraa.”</char></note> kɔhyɛ ye nguraen; ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bamaa aleɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aleɛ nwo mmeraa.”</char></note> alɛ́ b'adwene ne, bennya mvasoɛ biala wɔ so.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Afɔleɛ bokyea bɔ yɛle ye ne de, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma wɔ <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nanu ne, belle ye nwo atee kyɛ bɛdi nikye bɔ ɔwɔ so ne bie. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ngaka bɔ né sɔfo panyi ne fa bɛ mogya kɔ krongron nu krongron berɛ kɔbɔ bɔne nwo afɔleɛ ne, né bɛyera bɛ fuin ne wɔ nekaa bɔ basikye ne si. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ɛhe ati, Yesu koso nwuni amaneɛ wɔ kuro ne anoa ne si, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔfa ye bɔbɔ ye mogya kɔte mmenia nanwo. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Yeti, ɛmɔma yɛhɔ ye berɛ wɔ nekaa bɔ basikye ne si, na yɛɛsoa ye animguaseɛ ne bie. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Ofikyɛ ɛwa de, yɛlle kuro biala bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa, mmom yɛnea kuro bɔ ɔba né atee paa. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Yeti, ɛmɔma yɛfa ye so yɛbɔ ayɛyie afɔleɛ yɛma Nyameɛ daa, na ɛhene yeɛ ole yɛ noa bɔ yɛkɔfa yɛkɔbɔ ye dumaa wɔ mmenia nu ne. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ wora fi kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ mmenia pa, na ɛmɔ ne bɛ ahyɛ nningyein bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ nye sɔ afɔleɛ bɔ ɔte sɔ ne paa.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Ɛmɔyɛ sotie bɛma bɛ bɔ bɛli ɛmɔ nyunu ne, na ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma bɛ, ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ bɛnea ɛmɔ kra so ɔ, na bɛkobu ye nwo ngondaa. Yeti, ɛmɔma bɛfa anigye bɛyɛ adwuma ne, nnɛmɔ maa bɛfa aworaborɛ bɛyɛ, wanyɛ sɔ a, ongosi ɛmɔ yé.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma yɛ, ofikyɛ yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ yɛle ahonim pa, na yɛpena kyɛ yɛdi nahorɛ wɔ nikye biala nu. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Na bɔ mesrɛ ɛmɔ paa yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔyakyi me bɛkɔma ɛmɔ ndɛ ɔ.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Afei asomdwie Nyameɛ bɔ ɔnate apam bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa ne mogya naso tingyele y'Awurade Yesu, bɔ ɔte mmoan-nneafoɛ panyi ne fili awufo nu ne, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />ɔma ɛmɔ nikye pa biala bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ ye apɛdeɛ. Na ɔfa Yesu Kristo so yɛ yɛnu adwuma ma yɛyɛ bɔ ɔkuro ɔ, ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye daa daa. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Aliemaa mɔ, mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔnya aboterɛ betie me afutuo he, ofikyɛ me krataa ne, ɔnwale.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, bayakyi yɛliema Timoteo. Na sɛ ɔba ndɛ a, mene ye kɔɔnea ɛmɔ boso.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Ɛmɔhyea bɛ bɔ bɛli ɛmɔ nyunu ne akrongronfoɛ namukoraati bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 13:24">Bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Italy ne nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Adom ha mɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>